      "summary": "Review candidate built from the 6 November meeting with Pedro. Not launched: the live website is unchanged and the Phase 8 production hold remains.",
      "changes": [
        "The idle pop-up offer has been removed from every page.",
        "The founder-video placeholder is hidden until Pedro records his video; his photo and vision text stay.",
        "The homepage hero now shows all three offerings: Property & Facilities, Workplaces & Commercial, and Homes. On phones they appear straight under the headline.",
        "Agreed copy and buttons from the approved copy documents are restored: in-page buttons, closing button pairs, homepage sections, contact and quote page text, page titles and descriptions.",
        "The Contact page has the WhatsApp button again for sending requested photos or video (07824 390336), including on phones.",
        "More images on text-heavy sections, and new page heroes replacing photos Pedro marked \"skip\".",
        "Images are labelled honestly: generated, stock and not-yet-confirmed photos say \"Illustrative image\", and no gallery claims to show HQC work until Pedro confirms the photos.",
        "Image descriptions for screen readers now describe the scene instead of claiming a cleaning result."
